		{"01", "前端代码里不出现 localStorage.setItem('access_token'|'refresh_token')",
			"grep -rn \"localStorage.setItem.*token\" web/",
			"这是最容易被「临时调试」留下的漏洞，必须机械拦"},
		{"04", "日志里不出现整枚 token",
			"grep -rn 'Authorization.*%s\\|Bearer.*%v\\|token.*%s' srv/ | grep -i log",
